  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mitigating the impact of conflict escalation in Lebanon through conflict prevention, security service provision, and peacebuilding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;To urgently mitigate the effects of the current situation in Lebanon on economic, social and institutional stability, the intervention aims addressing impact of the multiple crises and contribute to the fostering of a more peaceful, stable, and inclusive society by strengthening security, stability, and social peace.&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;The project will specifically focus on &lt;/span&gt;bolstering capacities of the Tensions Monitoring System to provide evidence-based data and analysis on communal relations and social stability, enhancing security service provision, and supporting local conflict prevention and peacebuilding initiatives. Additionally, UNDP will enhance the Lebanon Mine Action Centre&apos;s capabilities to manage explosive ordnance risks, ensuring safety for vulnerable populations and facilitating conditions for return, recovery and development. As such, the four expected outputs are:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xbf;Output 1 - &lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Bolstered capacities of the Tensions Monitoring System&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xbf;Output 2 - &lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Enhanced security service provision&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xbf;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Output 3 &lt;/span&gt; - &lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Enhanced local capacities for conflict prevention and peacebuilding&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xbf;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Output 4&lt;/span&gt; &#xbf; &lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Support provided to the Lebanon Action Mine Centre&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
